cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or its build pipeline, please cite it as follows."
title: "Tampa Published Development Records: Source-Bounded Census"
type: dataset
version: 0.8.0
date-released: 2026-08-28
authors:
  - family-names: Lenga
    given-names: Jack
abstract: >-
  A reproducible census of every feature returned by eight named City of Tampa
  ArcGIS layers at a recorded snapshot time, with explicit source-universe
  definitions and count reconciliation, plus separately scoped event, capital-
  budget, and privacy-minimized linked-parcel context tables. Completeness
  applies to the eight published core-layer snapshots, not to all permits,
  real-world development, parcels, or investment.
keywords:
  - Tampa
  - urban development
  - open data
  - building permits
  - capital projects
  - bounded census
  - reproducible research
